A travel booking collects flight details from customers, the system should whether al mandatory details have been provide with valid details, if the customer provides invalid details like for passenger name xyz return false and ask the customer to rewrite with valid credentials,
the destination city should be different with departure city ,
and travel date should be future date,
number of passengers should be different should be within the available limit of seats, 
and travel class should be within the available categories.
Required Fields:
• Passenger Name
• Departure City
• Destination City
• Travel Date
• Number of Passengers
• Travel Class
If any fields are missing ask customer to type the missing details.   
